40,4308,1152,'GCNo11002018TR-AO00822019','FormTypeM','2020-06-15 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','1205','1107','Orders','','Due to the outbreak of the COVID-19 having been declared pandemic and subsequent order bearing No.13180-HIII (5)/2020, dated 03.05.2020 of the Administrator, UT, Chandigarh, all the government offices in the State of UT were to function w.e.f. 04.05.2020 outside the containment area.  Now, vide order bearing No. 13180-HIII (5)/2020, dated 11.05.2020, the Chandigarh Administration, has decided to start the public dealings in government offices from 18.05.2020 (instead of 11.05.2020 as ordered earlier). As such, the file shall be taken up on 15.06.2020 for the purpose already fixed. Parties be notified.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','2020-05-16 13:12:31.000','',1,0,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-05-16 13:12:31.000','executiveassistantao','2020-05-16 13:12:31.000'),(3441,4309,1350,'GCNo12442019TR-AO00652019','FormTypeM','2020-06-15 00:00:00.000','10:00 AM','1205','1107','Orders','','Due to the outbreak of the COVID-19 having been declared pandemic and subsequent order bearing No.13180-HIII (5)/2020, dated 03.05.2020 of the Administrator, UT, Chandigarh, all the government offices in the State of UT were to function w.e.f. 04.05.2020 outside the containment area.  Now, vide order bearing No. 13180-HIII (5)/2020, dated 11.05.2020, the Chandigarh Administration, has decided to start the public dealings in government offices from 18.05.2020 (instead of 11.05.2020 as ordered earlier). As such, the file shall be taken up on 15.06.2020 for the purpose already fixed. Parties be notified.','Hearing','Sh. Balbir Singh, Adjudicating Officer','0','2020-05-16 13:16:31.000','',1,0,0,0,'executiveassistantao','2020-05-16 13:16:31.000','executiveassistantao','2020-05-16 13:16:31.000'),(3442,4310,1831,'GCNo15752020','FormTypeM','2020-05-28 00:00:00.000','11:00 AM','1204','1102','Notice for Appearance/Reply','','','Hearing','Sh. Sanjiv Gupta, Me